(@ SECTION "Command Usage")

(@ PARAGRAPH

"The (@ CODE \"calm1\") command can be used as a filter in a
Unix-style pipeline, or with a list of input files and a specified
output file, or in a mixture of the two usage modes. The command
options are listed by the “(@ CODE \"calm1 --help\")” command—")

(@ dnl)
(@ dnl)  Run calm1 to get its usage message.
(@ dnl)
(@ SCRIPT "(@ include-raw \"calm1 --help|\")")
